	<row id="msg_0613_T27FS0101_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My EEVEE turned into a ESPEON.\rMy homie’s EEVEE turned into a\nUMBREON.\rWe raised ’em EXACTLY the same! I\nthink he lyin’. He fed his after\fmidnight.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0613_T27FS0101_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Use Smellin’ Salts and a fainted homie\nwake RIGHT up. It’s like ammonia\fand bad decisions.</language>
	</row>
